      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I assume you're referring to Quest, as this is the only platform where what's being described is an \"issue\".\nThere's a reason why there's restrictions, yet people will ignore them at any chance they can get. Then blame the game for performance problems, or crashing issues when in most cases it was entirely the Users fault for ignoring these restrictions.\nIn-fact according the Docs, VRChat is considering the removal of Very Poor avatars entirely on Quest VRChat.\nhttps://docs.vrchat.com/docs/avatar-performance-ranking-system#quest-limits",
